message: "If you use this repository, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "CIYFI: Sea Turtle Head Detection as an Initial Stage for Individual Re-identification"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Pérez Barahona"
    given-names: "Pedro Luis"
    orcid: ""
repository-code: "https://github.com/LuisBarahonaMX/CIYFI"
url: "https://github.com/LuisBarahonaMX/CIYFI"
license: "Apache-2.0"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-30"
abstract: >
  CIYFI is a computer vision project focused on sea turtle head detection
  as an initial stage toward individual re-identification. The current
  validated stage uses YOLOv8n for head detection and includes independent
  evaluation, reproducibility documentation, error analysis, and model artifacts.
keywords:
  - sea turtle
  - computer vision
  - YOLOv8
  - wildlife monitoring
  - re-identification
  - deep learning
  - conservation
